      "title": "⚡ Guide: Viggle Turbo v0.3 (9-Step) 360° VR Panorama",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# ⚡ Qwen 360 Turbo Panorama Studio (4K Bilateral Pipeline)\n\nUltra-fast (~20s) generation + **4K RealESRGAN 2×** + **Subtle Bilateral Cleanup**.\n\n### 🔄 Full Pipeline\n1. **Text/Image Conditioning**: Dual LoRA stack (Pano360 + Viggle Turbo v0.3).\n2. **Lightning 9-step Sampling**: Custom refined sigmas (7 turbo + 2 high-precision).\n3. **4K Toroidal Upscale**: RealESRGAN 2× with 5% boundary wrap.\n4. **Subtle Bilateral Filter**: Mild d=5, sigmaColor=15 edge-preserving noise cleanup.\n5. **VR 360 Viewer & Export**: Interactive WebGL sphere viewer + Photo Sphere XMP metadata."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {},
      "color": "#1e3a8a",
      "bgcolor": "#172554"
    },
